# Generated local demo assets (scripts/make_mock_demo_videos.py) — large
# raw Motion-JPEG AVIs + a machine-local registry with absolute paths.
# The small committed H.264 demo clips under demo_assets/clips/ are the
# exception: they ARE tracked so a fresh clone can run the mock ANPR demo
# (see DEMO_RUNBOOK.md + data/demo_camera_registry.json).
demo_assets/*
!demo_assets/clips/
demo_assets/clips/*
!demo_assets/clips/*.mp4
data/mock_camera_registry.json

# Local Anand/Gujarat traffic video dataset used to drive MOCK_CAM* dev
# cameras (scripts/generate_mock_camera_registry.py, scripts/run_mock_cameras.py).
# ~1.7GB of source video -- not source code, not committed. The generated
# registry embeds machine-local absolute paths into this folder, same reason
# data/mock_camera_registry.json above is ignored.
trafficdataset/
data/trafficdataset_camera_registry.json
# scripts/hackathon_rehearsal.py's generated 50-camera registry -- same
# machine-local-absolute-path reason as above.
data/rehearsal_camera_registry.json

